language design-core version 0.6.
functionality CaptureSessionDesignBasis.
message CheckCurrentDesignBasis.
contract DesignBasisQuery.
field DesignBasisQueryAssessment.
field DesignBasisQueryBlueprint.
field DesignBasisQuerySession.
field DesignBasisQueryTask.
field DesignBasisQueryWork.
contract DesignBasisResult.
field DesignBasisResultHolds.
field DesignBasisResultRevision.
scenario InspectDesignBeforeOwnerDisposition.
message SessionDesignBasisChecked.
channel SessionModelChecks.
contract SessionModelChecksProtocol.
CaptureSessionDesignBasis allocated-to SdpToolHost in mode RoutineHandling.
CaptureSessionDesignBasis contributes-to SessionExecution.
CaptureSessionDesignBasis realizes GovernedSessionLifecycle.
CheckCurrentDesignBasis has message-kind = request.
CheckCurrentDesignBasis upholds DesignBasisQuery.
DesignBasisQuery has completeness = closed.
DesignBasisQuery has-field DesignBasisQueryAssessment.
DesignBasisQuery has-field DesignBasisQueryBlueprint.
DesignBasisQuery has-field DesignBasisQuerySession.
DesignBasisQuery has-field DesignBasisQueryTask.
DesignBasisQuery has-field DesignBasisQueryWork.
DesignBasisQueryAssessment has presence = required.
DesignBasisQueryAssessment has value-type = text.
DesignBasisQueryBlueprint has presence = required.
DesignBasisQueryBlueprint has value-type = text.
DesignBasisQuerySession has presence = required.
DesignBasisQuerySession has value-type = text.
DesignBasisQueryTask has presence = required.
DesignBasisQueryTask has value-type = text.
DesignBasisQueryWork has presence = required.
DesignBasisQueryWork has value-type = text.
DesignBasisResult has completeness = closed.
DesignBasisResult has-field DesignBasisResultHolds.
DesignBasisResult has-field DesignBasisResultRevision.
DesignBasisResultHolds has presence = required.
DesignBasisResultHolds has value-type = text.
DesignBasisResultRevision has presence = required.
DesignBasisResultRevision has value-type = text.
InspectDesignBeforeOwnerDisposition exercises ExecuteCardDerivedSession.
InspectDesignBeforeOwnerDisposition has completeness = closed.
InspectDesignBeforeOwnerDisposition illustrates SessionWorkflowDelivery.
InspectDesignBeforeOwnerDisposition runs-in RoutineHandling.
InspectDesignBeforeOwnerDisposition step 1 sends CheckCurrentDesignBasis from SessionCoordinator to ModelGateAdapter via SessionModelChecks.
InspectDesignBeforeOwnerDisposition step 2 sends SessionDesignBasisChecked from ModelGateAdapter to SessionCoordinator via SessionModelChecks reply-to 1.
ModelGateAdapter owns CaptureSessionDesignBasis.
ModelGateAdapter uses SessionModelChecks as receiver of CheckCurrentDesignBasis in mode RoutineHandling.
ModelGateAdapter uses SessionModelChecks as sender of SessionDesignBasisChecked in mode RoutineHandling.
SessionCoordinator uses SessionModelChecks as receiver of SessionDesignBasisChecked in mode RoutineHandling.
SessionCoordinator uses SessionModelChecks as sender of CheckCurrentDesignBasis in mode RoutineHandling.
SessionDesignBasisChecked has message-kind = result.
SessionDesignBasisChecked replies-to CheckCurrentDesignBasis.
SessionDesignBasisChecked upholds DesignBasisResult.
SessionModelChecks upholds SessionModelChecksProtocol.
SessionModelChecksProtocol has completeness = closed.
SessionModelChecksProtocol permits CheckCurrentDesignBasis.
SessionModelChecksProtocol permits SessionDesignBasisChecked.
SessionWorkflowDelivery addresses CaptureSessionDesignBasis.
